  "body": "In one of St Heliers most sought-after positions, this smart one-bedroom apartment puts the very best of the Bays right on your doorstep. Tucked just off the village centre, you'll enjoy the energy of cafes, restaurants and boutique shopping while appreciating the privacy and convenience of your own ground-floor retreat.\r\nPerfect for busy professionals, singles, downsizers or those seeking a lock-up-and-leave base, this easy-care apartment offers comfortable open-plan living, a dedicated off-street car park, and a location that's hard to beat.\r\nLeave the car at home and stroll to the beach for a morning swim, grab coffee around the corner, or hop onto Tamaki Drive for an easy commute to the CBD. Compact, convenient and brilliantly positioned, this is the kind of property that delivers lifestyle far beyond its footprint.\r\nAffordable buying in an iconic St Heliers location. Don't miss your opportunity.\r\nAsking Price $839,000.  Contact Murray Wallace for details.",
